# Puppet Crafting: "{4}{G}: Return this card from your graveyard to your hand." Bot1 enchants its Ornithopter on turn 1 (a 5/5
# thopter Construct). On turn 3, with all five Moxen tapped for mana, the ability is not offered from the battlefield (the refusal): it
# works from a graveyard only. On turn 4 Bot2's Disenchant destroys the Ornithopter; the Aura, enchanting nothing, is put into its
# owner's graveyard as a state-based action (CR 704.5m). On turn 5 all five Moxen pay {4}{G} (the positive control) and the card goes
# to Bot1's hand from the graveyard; the pool is empty afterwards, so the cost was exactly five.

